 "text": "Hello there! How's your day treating you? Sure. Things to bring are usually simple. sandwiches, fruit, crisps, a few snacks, a bottle of water, a chair or blanket. Pack few extra things you can make easily, like fruit kebabs, or risotto. Pack small pot and pan so you can make them. A light Parasol and some sunscreen are essential. Then a Stippy straw hat and a thin jumper are worth the space. Cheese and bread are usually the most popular things to run out of. Pack small box of those, and you be busy all afternoon.",
